/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2004 StTriggerData2004

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 4 (year 2004) trigger data.

\section sec2004_overview Overview

StTriggerData2004 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 4 (year 2004)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TrgDataType2004 structure and
exposes its content through the common StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2003, Run 4 adds the <b>ZDC Shower-Maximum Detector (ZDC-SMD)</b>
readout via zdcSMD().

\section sec2004_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2004
\endcode

\section sec2004_runyear Run Year
Run 4, calendar year 2004 &mdash; Au+Au collisions at &radic;s = 200 GeV.

\section sec2004_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TrgDataType2004* | Pointer to the raw Run 4 trigger bank in memory. |

\section sec2004_new New Compared to 2003

- zdcSMD(StBeamDirection eastwest, int verthori, int strip, int prepost=0) &mdash;
  ZDC Shower-Maximum Detector strip ADC.  \c verthori selects vertical (0) or horizontal (1)
  readout plane; \c strip selects the strip number.

getDsm0_BEMCE(), getDsm0_BEMCW(), and getDsm1_BEMC() return \c nullptr for this format.

\section sec2004_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short zdcSmdEastV3 = trgData->zdcSMD(east, 0, 3, 0);
    unsigned short bbcWest      = trgData->bbcADCSum(west, 0);
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2003
\see StTriggerData2005
*/
